  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance (TA) to enhance value addition, market access and competitiveness of private sector in Namibia in order to promote trade under the EPA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Technical Assistance (TA) to enhance value addition, market access and competitiveness of private sector in Namibia in order to promote trade under the EPA - The main objective of the Decision is to enhance Namibia&apos;s trade and business opportunities by promoting the full implementation of the EU SADC-EPA.</narrative>
  </description>
